  "title": "Everything You Need to Know About Autonomous Post-Production",
  "summary": "Autonomous post-production uses AI to automate video editing, cutting 70% of manual time by analyzing footage, generating clips, and applying branding. Tools like Overlap and Adobe Premiere Pro handle ingestion, enhancement, and export for TikTok/Reels. Best practices include high-quality inputs, custom prompts, and human review. Creators scale 10x output with consistent quality, boosting engagement like Y Combinator pros.",
